    old "The idea of having sex with a man of his age had seemed absurd to her, laughable. Now it was simply fact. Undeniable that he had conquered her body."
    new "그의 나이와 성관계를 갖는다는 생각은 그녀에게 터무니없고 웃기게만 느껴졌었다. 하지만 이제는 그저 현실일 뿐이었다. 그가 그녀의 몸을 정복했다는 것은 부정할 수 없는 사실이었다."

    old "He spoke some more words, seemingly appreciative, as he groped at her body."
