    old "Moments of exhaustion, switched with moments of intense physicality."
    new "지친 순간과 강렬한 육체적 순간이 번갈아 나타났다."

    old "The man's stamina belied his age."
    new "그 남자의 체력은 그의 나이와는 맞지 않았다."

    old "He ran her body ragged as he took her in any position imaginable, and some Sarah had never imagined."
